      "content": "We must discard the notion that voting is merely an elective option for those who feel comfortable. If you stake a claim on being a member of this community, then civic participation is not a suggestion; it is a covenant. To argue you are exempt from the process is to admit you are exempt from the responsibilities of citizenship itself. Attend the polls, because being present is the only path to protecting the society you claim to value.",
